      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bedok",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1975, the Housing and Development Board launched Bedok's first HDB flats, marking its birth as Singapore's fifth self‑contained new town.",
